            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_11",
            type: "Troll Shaman",
            side: 5,
            x: 21,
            y: 21,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_11",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_12",
            type: "Troll Shaman",
            side: 5,
            x: 26,
            y: 14,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_12",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_13",
            type: "Troll Shaman",
            side: 5,
            x: 31,
            y: 21,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_13",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("Well, we’ve put some distance between us and the elves, so we have a little time to think. What is this place?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thursagan",
            text: _("Remember what Khrakrahs said, about this being a volcano? Well, it seems we’re under the crater, sitting on the magma chamber... I think we should try to cause it to erupt."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("Huh, makes sense. It will kill all the elves, and we might be able to find a safe place so the lava doesn’t kill us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baglur",
            text: _("Yes, an interesting plan. How do you propose we do this?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thursagan",
            text: _("Look up! If this were a normal volcano, you’d see stars and sky. Instead, there’s a high ceiling, shaped like a cone. This means that something must be holding back the volcano’s lava flow. This thing, if it exists, could be our chance to trigger an eruption. The first place I would consider investigating would be the center of this chamber."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("I see, yes. Quite a gamble, yet what choice do we have? Let’s explore and hope we find something like what you describe."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Krawg",
            text: _("Krah! <i>(Looks about the cave, adopts a hostile stance, then glances back at the dwarves.)</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thursagan",
            text: _("Indeed, Krawg, we are not alone down here. Orcs and trolls are prowling around."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_32",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
